<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.7989 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.7989 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.7989 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.7000 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 12		  Sep 11</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.7989		 68.7000</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  0.695		   7.045</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.8694		 45.5800</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.310		   0.195</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
